		<<case 1>>음...
		<<case 2>>읍!
		<<case 3>>아...
		<<case 4>>흥...
		<<case 5>>으읏!
		<<case 6>>음...
	<</switch>>
<</widget>>
<<widget "poppyChastityKey">>
	<<switch random(1, 6)>>
		<<case 1>>네 작은 감옥이 영원히 버티진 못할 거야
		<<case 2>>이 정조대를 피할 방법이 분명 있을 거야
		<<case 3>>이걸로 나를 영원히 막을 순 없어
		<<case 4>>열쇠를 찾아낼 거야
		<<case 5>>곧 그걸 풀어 줄게
		<<case 6>>여는 법을 알아낼 거야
	<</switch>>
<</widget>>
<<widget "poppyChooseEndearment">>
	/* Case 1 is a no-op, keep whatever _poppyTerm already is.
	   Fallback at the end handles the first-call case where it's undefined. */
	<<switch random(1, 6)>>
		<<case 2>><<set _poppyTerm to "자기야">>
		<<case 3>><<set _poppyTerm to "내 사랑">>
		<<case 4>><<set _poppyTerm to "귀염둥이">>
		<<case 5>><<set _poppyTerm to "내 보석">>
		<<case 6>><<set _poppyTerm to "예쁜이">>
	<</switch>>
	<<if !_poppyTerm>><<set _poppyTerm to "내 보석">><</if>>
<</widget>>

